#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Do not verify is logged when set and shown as a warning on the health page while it stays."
msgstr "Ha xaqiijin waa la diiwaangeliyaa marka la dejiyo waxaana loo muujiyaa sidii digniin bogga caafimaadka inta ay jirto."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "CA Bundle File"
msgstr "Faylka Xirmada CA"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Habka xirmada CA: waddo buuxda oo ku taal poller-ka oo u socota fayl PEM ah oo aanay kuwa kale wax ku qori karin."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Habka biinka ah: base64 SHA-256 ee furaha dadweynaha BMC, sida sha256//... ama hash-ka qaawan. Fure la beddelay wuu fashilmaa ilaa tan la cusboonaysiiyo."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Public Key Pin"
msgstr "Biinka Furaha Dadweynaha"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Allow Basic Authentication Fallback"
msgstr "Ogolow Dib-u-dhaca Xaqiijinta Basic"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Used only when the BMC offers no session service. Every request then carries the password; the health page warns while it is in use."
msgstr "Waxaa la isticmaalaa oo keliya marka BMC uusan bixin adeeg fadhi. Codsi kasta wuxuu markaas qaadaa erayga sirta ah; bogga caafimaadka ayaa digniin bixiya inta la isticmaalayo."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "The Cacti device of the server this BMC manages. Leave it at none to have the plugin create a device from the list."
msgstr "Qalabka Cacti ee server-ka uu maamulo BMC-gan. U daa waxba si uu plugin-ku uga sameeyo qalab liiska."

