msgstr "Waxaa lagu kaydiyay iyadoo lagu sir-xidhay furaha khasnadda."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedyada Redfish si buuxda looma rakibin. Dib uga rakib bogga Redfish BMCs."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Qalab \\\"%s\\\" oo ka yimid qaab-dhismeedka qalabka %s, oo uu ururiyay poller %d, iyadoo hubinta helitaanku dansan tahay. Magaca martigeliyaha waa magac gaar ah oo aan waligiis lala xiriirin."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Weydiinta xogta \\\"%s\\\", oo leh jaantus loogu talagalay mid kasta oo ka mid ah %d xubnood ee hadda la yaqaan."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "%d marawaxado ama sahay koronto oo horay u jiray hadda lama soo sheego. Waxaa loo tiriyaa inay fashilmeen ilaa aad xaqiijiso; xaqiijintu waxay aqbashaa xubnaha uu BMC soo sheego hadda."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Jaantuska \\\"%s\\\", oo leh isha xogtiisa \\\"%s\\\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "BMC horay ayaa loogu xiray qalab."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Waxaa sameeyay plugin-ka Redfish ee BMC %s. Qiimayaashiisu waxay ka yimaadaan kaydka ku meel gaarka ah ee plugin-ka; magaca martigeliyaha waa magac gaar ah oo aan waligiis lala xiriirin."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti way diiday inay abuurto qalabka. Eeg diiwaanka Cacti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Qalabka cusub waxaa kaa qarin lahaa ogolaanshahaaga qalabka, sidaas darteed dib ayaa loo saaray. Weydii maamule inuu ku siiyo ogolaansho, ama ku xir BMC qalab aad arki karto."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "BMC waxaa qalab ku xiray qof kale intii lagu jiray, ama lama xiri karin, sidaas darteed qalabka cusub dib ayaa loo saaray. Dib u soo rar bogga oo hubi xiriirintiisa."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedyada Redfish lama rakibi karin: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedyada Redfish lama rakibin ama ma aha kuwii u dambeeyay. Dib uga rakib bogga Redfish BMCs."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: qalabkiisa Cacti waa la tirtiray. Ku xir qalab kale ama ka samee mid bogga BMCs."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: qalabkiisa waxaa ururiya poller %d laakiin BMC waxaa akhriya poller %d. Midkood u rari si labaduba u isticmaalaan isku poller, ama jaantusyadiisu waxay u muuqan karaan kuwo aan la aqoon."

