#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Khasnadda Aqoonsiga Sirta ah"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Faylka Furaha Khasnadda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Waddo buuxda oo u socota furaha 32-byte ee sir-xidha erayada sirta ah ee BMC ee kaydsan. Adigu samayso, meel ka baxsan xididka shabakadda, oo ay akhrin karaan oo keliya server-ka shabakadda iyo isticmaalaha poller-ka, galka ay ku qori karaan oo keliya root iyo isticmaalahaas; plugin-ku waligiis ma abuuro mana qoro. La kaydi keydka xogta: la'aantiis, erayada sirta ah ee kaydsan waa in mar kale la geliyo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Ururiyaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Muddada Ururinta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada u dhexeeya akhrinta BMC kasta."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Xilliga Dib-u-helidda"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada u dhexeeya sahaminta buuxda ee kheyraadka BMC kasta. BMC sidoo kale isla markiiba dib ayaa loo sahamiyaa marka kheyraad la yaqaan uu lumo ama noociisa beddelo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Miisaaniyadda Waqtiga Ururiyaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada uu hal orod oo ururiye ahi qaadan karo ka hor intaanu joojin bilaabista BMCs cusub. Ka hoosaysii xilliga poller-ka; BMCs-ka aan dhammaan waxay sii socdaan orodka xiga."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "BMCs-ka isku mar la akhriyo. BMC kasta waxaa hal mar akhriya hal hawlwadeen."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Hawlwadeennada Ururiyaha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga Dhammaadka Xiriirka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada loo oggol yahay xiriirka TCP iyo is-gacan-qaadka TLS ee lala yeelanayo BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Waqtiga Dhammaadka Codsiga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Ilbiriqsiyada loo oggol yahay hal codsi oo dhammaystiran oo loo diro BMC, oo ay ku jirto xiriirku."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB ee laga aqbalo hal jidh jawaab BMC ah; jawaab ka weyn waa la diidaa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Cabirka Jawaabta Ugu Badan"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Cusboonaanta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Xilliyada ururinta ee ka dib akhrinta loo muujiyo inay dib u dhacday."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Dib u Dhacay Ka Dib"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Xilliyada ururinta ee ka dib akhrintu ay duug noqoto oo loo akhriyo sidii aan la aqoon. Had iyo jeer ugu yaraan hal ka badan Dib u Dhacay Ka Dib."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Duugooba Ka Dib"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Ka saar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Ilaali Jadwalka Plugin-ka Marka La Saarayo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Marka la calaamadiyo, ka saarista plugin-ku waxay haysataa diiwaanka BMC, erayada sirta ah ee la sir-xidhay, iyo kaydka akhrinta. Ka saar calaamadda si ka saaristu u tirtirto. Ka saaristu waligeed ma taabato qalabka Cacti, jaantusyada, ama BMCs-ka, oo ay ku jiraan qalabka uu plugin-ku abuuray."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Ku xaqiiji kaydka CA ee nidaamka"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Ku xaqiiji faylka xirmada CA"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Furaha dadweynaha ee biinka leh (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Ha xaqiijin (ammaan ma aha)"

