msgid "The BMC and its cached data were deleted. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "BMC iyo xogtiisa kaydka ah waa la tirtiray. Qalabkiisa Cacti halkiisii ayaa lagu dhaafay."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Backoff and held failures were cleared; the collector reads the BMC on its next run."
msgstr "Dib-u-dhigista iyo fashilada la hayay waa la nadiifiyay; ururiyuhu wuxuu akhriyaa BMC orodkiisa xiga."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Adding devices and graphs needs Cacti's device management permission."
msgstr "Ku darista qalabka iyo jaantusyada waxay u baahan tahay ogolaanshaha maamulka qalabka ee Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device of this BMC was deleted. Choose another device, or none, on the BMC form first."
msgstr "Qalabka BMC-gan waa la tirtiray. Marka hore ka dooro qalab kale, ama waxba, foomka BMC."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data queries were indexed again and %d graphs were added."
msgstr "Weydiimaha xogta dib ayaa loo tusmeeyay waxaana lagu daray %d jaantusyo."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device was created with its Redfish graphs."
msgstr "Qalabka waxaa lagu abuuray jaantusyadiisa Redfish."

