msgstr "Rakibidda qaab-dhismeedyada Redfish waxay u baahan tahay ogolaanshaha Soo Dejinta Qaab-dhismeedyada ee Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are installed."
msgstr "Qaab-dhismeedyada Redfish waa la rakibay."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
